# Experiment isolation

Doorbell / house / run-folder:

- CLI: `scripts/<name>_experiment|confirmation|ablation.py` (thin; no policy)
- Record: `experiments/active|archived/<name>/` (manifest, README, fixtures)
- Logic: `writing_rag/<boundary>/` (shared; no fork of hubs)

Hard: no retrieve/plan/select/generate/verify policy in `scripts/`.
Soft: CLI ≤150 lines preferred; ≤250 only for runtime/I/O glue; still no policy.

- Experiment code must not change production retrieval, generation, or verification.
- Do not copy 1700-line confirmation scripts; share a harness or config instead.
- Do not treat fluency, aggregate Recall@10 alone, or scaffold richness as promotion.
- Record decisions in the experiment README and `docs/architecture/experiment-ledger.md`.
- Archived paths stay archived unless the ledger lists a revisit condition.
